# Render scale: the UI cursor must end up in the same place at every scale (the pointer maps to Device.dwWidth/dwHeight, the output's
# size, never the scene's). Opens the inventory and moves the pointer twice; compare the cursor sprite's position of the shots of a run
# with `-x "r__render_scale 1.0"` and one with 0.67 (run at the same -s size).
1 console run_string xr_harness.env(12,0,"w_clear1")
3 console run_string xr_harness.tp(-2.8,2.8,82.7,200)
8 key I
12 move 1066 519
15 console screenshot 23_a_hover_pistol
16 move 1066 1060
19 console screenshot 23_b_hover_knife
21 key Escape
23 quit
